{"title":"2017 AMC 12A Problems/Problem 2","text":"<div class=\"mw-content-ltr mw-parser-output\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\"><div id=\"toc\" class=\"toc\" role=\"navigation\" aria-labelledby=\"mw-toc-heading\"><input type=\"checkbox\" role=\"button\" id=\"toctogglecheckbox\" class=\"toctogglecheckbox\" style=\"display:none\" /><div class=\"toctitle\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\"><h2 id=\"mw-toc-heading\">Contents</h2><span class=\"toctogglespan\"><label class=\"toctogglelabel\" for=\"toctogglecheckbox\"></label></span></div>\n<ul>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-1\"><a href=\"#Problem\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">1</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Problem</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-2\"><a href=\"#Solution\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">2</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Solution</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-3\"><a href=\"#Solution_2\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">3</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Solution 2</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-4\"><a href=\"#Video_Solution_(HOW_TO_THINK_CREATIVELY!!!)\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">4</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Video Solution (HOW TO THINK CREATIVELY!!!)</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-5\"><a href=\"#See_Also\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">5</span> <span class=\"toctext\">See Also</span></a></li>\n</ul>\n</div>\n\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Problem\">Problem</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2017_AMC_12A_Problems/Problem_2&amp;action=edit&amp;section=1\" title=\"Edit section: Problem\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>The sum of two nonzero real numbers is 4 times their product. What is the sum of the reciprocals of the two numbers?\n</p><p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/5/7/1/571c1026e49506d70e6e271bdb9920253b289b54.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\textbf{(A)}\\ 1\\qquad\\textbf{(B)}\\ 2\\qquad\\textbf{(C)}\\ 4\\qquad\\textbf{(D)}\\ 8\\qquad\\textbf{(E)}\\ 12$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"357\" height=\"17\" />\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Solution\">Solution</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2017_AMC_12A_Problems/Problem_2&amp;action=edit&amp;section=2\" title=\"Edit section: Solution\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>Let <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/3/2/5/32581661cddf01ad30c1e36efe72f99eb0a0adca.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$x, y$\" style=\"vertical-align: -3px\" width=\"27\" height=\"11\" /> be our two numbers. Then <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/2/9/1/291e4f819fc3a5992cd76aecd7b326a9552861a0.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$x+y = 4xy$\" style=\"vertical-align: -3px\" width=\"95\" height=\"15\" />. Thus, \n</p><p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/b/c/9/bc91cce43523068dfd1acbe77fe825fa70a274ea.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\frac{1}{x} + \\frac{1}{y} = \\frac{x+y}{xy} = 4$\" style=\"vertical-align: -16px\" width=\"154\" height=\"40\" />. \n</p><p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/f/9/9/f99012341ff701c012589a6972d9c4f8e866285d.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\boxed{ \\textbf{C}}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -5px\" width=\"25\" height=\"23\" />.\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Solution_2\">Solution 2</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2017_AMC_12A_Problems/Problem_2&amp;action=edit&amp;section=3\" title=\"Edit section: Solution 2\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>We can let <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/8/1/1/811204e3412eaf90240c65f8327e1815d2a0cc80.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$x=y.$\" style=\"vertical-align: -3px\" width=\"47\" height=\"11\" /> Then, we have that <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/c/7/2/c7296ba1cce3c43f17bdd21e696e73473838e998.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$2x=4x^2$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"72\" height=\"17\" /> making <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/4/5/7/457915e9eda7e372c41e2152cd2465f21a0e97c4.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$x=\\tfrac{1}{2}.$\" style=\"vertical-align: -7px\" width=\"52\" height=\"23\" /> The answer is <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/b/1/3/b13f7020ccbf4fca0a3beb9346d90353a05a635a.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\dfrac{2}{x}=4=\\boxed{ \\textbf{C}}.$\" style=\"vertical-align: -13px\" width=\"104\" height=\"38\" /> ~ <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=User:Solasky\" title=\"User:Solasky\">Solasky</a> (<a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=User_talk:Solasky&amp;action=edit&amp;redlink=1\" class=\"new\" title=\"User talk:Solasky (page does not exist)\">talk</a>)\n</p>\n<h2><span id=\"Video_Solution_.28HOW_TO_THINK_CREATIVELY.21.21.21.29\"></span><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Video_Solution_(HOW_TO_THINK_CREATIVELY!!!)\">Video Solution (HOW TO THINK CREATIVELY!!!)</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2017_AMC_12A_Problems/Problem_2&amp;action=edit&amp;section=4\" title=\"Edit section: Video Solution (HOW TO THINK CREATIVELY!!!)\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p><a rel=\"nofollow\" class=\"external free\" href=\"https://youtu.be/fOakoTBF_cE\">https://youtu.be/fOakoTBF_cE</a>\n</p><p>~Education, the Study of Everything\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"See_Also\">See Also</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2017_AMC_12A_Problems/Problem_2&amp;action=edit&amp;section=5\" title=\"Edit section: See Also\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<table class=\"wikitable\" style=\"margin:0.5em auto; font-size:95%; border:1px solid black; width:80%;\">\n<tbody><tr>\n<td style=\"background:#ccf;text-align:center;\" colspan=\"3\">